  "headline": "Insulin detemir is not on FDA's shortage list; Corvale sites hold 19.8 and 21.7 days on hand; labeler plant has VAI inspections and a 2017 Warning Letter",
  "headline_cites": ["D3", "D1", "D2", "E9", "E7", "E8"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include insulin detemir as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 216 vials of the 10 mL presentation at 10.9 vials per day, providing 19.8 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 264 vials at 12.2 vials per day, providing 21.7 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product label (NDC 50090127600) names A-S Medication Solutions as the labeler and a registered plant with FEI 1450743.",
      "cites": ["E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA's most recent inspection of that plant ended 2026-08-12 and was classified VAI, with the classification known on 2026-10-14.",
      "cites": ["E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The same plant received a Warning Letter on 2017-06-05.",
      "cites": ["E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Check whether the current VAI status or the 2017 Warning Letter affects supply reliability for this product.",
      "cites": ["E7", "E8"]
    }
  ]
}
